{"id":"bea9a9bf09bc4171","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STCheckerCorrect.md","title":"STCheckerCorrect","display":"STCheckerCorrect","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"STCheckerCorrect","parameters":[],"formula_kind":"proof_obligation_formula"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"STCheckerCorrect"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"proof_obligation_formula"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：接口端点。有序参数：无（闭公式）。</p>\n<p>待以 ZFC 内核证明的检查器对应命题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ STCheckerCorrect)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(forall B\n  (forall C\n    (forall k (forall g (forall t (forall a (iff (@ STAccept B C k g t a) (@ STType B C k g t a))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bafe4358a9fbac87\" href=\"?note=bafe4358a9fbac87\" title=\"ZFC_STAccept\">STAccept</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed545317bea3234d\" href=\"?note=ed545317bea3234d\" title=\"ZFC_STType\">STType</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>这是待证明命题的陈述，不是一个已证明定理，也不加入公理集。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ STCheckerCorrect)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STAccept","status":"resolved","id":"bafe4358a9fbac87","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_STAccept|STAccept]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STType","status":"resolved","id":"ed545317bea3234d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_STAccept|STAccept]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"这是待证明命题的陈述，不是一个已证明定理，也不加入公理集。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":859,"backlinks":[{"id":"80fb57ef7d250c19","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STCheckerCorrect|STCheckerCorrect]]"},{"id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_STCheckerCorrect]]、[[规范公式/ZFC_CurryCheckerCorrect]]、[[规范公式/ZFC_PolyCheckerCorrect]]、[[规范公式/ZFC_L3CertificateCorrect]] 均无自由变量。`展开样例/` 另附已消去所有命名缩写与派生逻辑记号的文本，供检查语法；它们**仍然只是待证公式**。"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-771","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_STCheckerCorrect|STCheckerCorrect]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","bafe4358a9fbac87","ed545317bea3234d","593f9bdab4d60707"]}